node_modules/
.env
.env.local
dist/

# Real invoices may contain third-party PII — labels are committed, source docs are not.
# See ground-truth/LABELING.md for how to share the corpus.
ground-truth/docs/*
!ground-truth/docs/.gitkeep
# Synthetic fixture PDFs are NOT committed either — they are build output, rebuilt from
# ground-truth/fixtures/*.html with `npm run fixtures`. A committed binary can silently
# disagree with the source it was generated from; a one-command rebuild cannot.
